{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense&amp;Making</strong> is a tile-based strategy game where you become the Demon Lord and design your own dungeon to fight off invading enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the path enemies take, to where traps are placed and which monsters are summoned\u2014every tactical decision is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element works together to create your own unique defense strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/5b1927de025aa0d050b8af9e8df4e0c3.webp?t=1773392923\" width=354 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your dungeon by arranging paths, traps, and tiles. Intruders will follow the routes you lay out, and traps will hinder their advance. Create the most lethal dungeon possible and overwhelm your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/710178153451b0432c63e0ad4a0a4838.webp?t=1773392923\" width=497 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/10432ba3b7809d84ed718eba26e35600.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/10432ba3b7809d84ed718eba26e35600.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/10432ba3b7809d84ed718eba26e35600.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters and place traps to stop intruders. Traps are powerful but limited, while monsters spawn endlessly yet consume your dungeon\u2019s mana. Manage both resources wisely to maximize your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/b6872ab3b0db7a1a0907b251473a107e.webp?t=1773392923\" width=476 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/2a33e7e50d96166ea8abd4bd661b03a9.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/2a33e7e50d96166ea8abd4bd661b03a9.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/2a33e7e50d96166ea8abd4bd661b03a9.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research upgrades to enhance your monsters, dungeons, and traps. Each monster and tile can be reinforced in unique ways, making your dungeon deadlier over time. Intruders cannot grow stronger\u2014but you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/shops_and_card-based_deck_building?t=1773392923\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/3d2d4454b0ba4f12b72359e3f686692a.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/3d2d4454b0ba4f12b72359e3f686692a.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/3d2d4454b0ba4f12b72359e3f686692a.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your deck however you like. At shops, you can purchase items and adjust your deck. Special card-selection pages appear each round, allowing you to add or remove powerful cards strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/dfaf8720dc0decf30ec494a3b80feff1.webp?t=1773392923\" width=486 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4bd7c5631a890dfe096d42d39d813ac7.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4bd7c5631a890dfe096d42d39d813ac7.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4bd7c5631a890dfe096d42d39d813ac7.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of characters will appear, each with their own stories. Dialogue choices influence outcomes, adding layers of narrative and unexpected events. Who will become your ally, and who will turn out to be your enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense &amp; Making </strong>doesn\u2019t have a single correct solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you build your dungeon\u2014and how you choose to stop the invaders\u2014is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of chasing the perfect defense we hope you\u2019ll enjoy adapting to new challenges <br>and finding your own unique way to overcome them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496110?t=1773392923","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496110?t=1773392923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/055a51ae3c1e6cc27b1ce86aae8d7ead483d58d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773392923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/055a51ae3c1e6cc27b1ce86aae8d7ead483d58d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773392923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is set in a dark medieval fantasy world, depicting a society where survival of the fittest, discrimination, and violence are part of everyday life.\r\nWithin the game's narrative and worldbuilding, the following mature themes are indirectly or contextually present.\r\n\r\nWhile the game explores the brutality of the world and poses moral questions through these darker themes, it avoids explicit scenes that may cause direct discomfort to players.\r\nHowever, we kindly ask players who may be sensitive to such settings and tones to take this into consideration before playing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/4a439abd5d7caf463ad9221ce26c0f3f.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense&amp;Making</strong> is a tile-based strategy game where you become the Demon Lord and design your own dungeon to fight off invading enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the path enemies take, to where traps are placed and which monsters are summoned\u2014every tactical decision is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element works together to create your own unique defense strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/5b1927de025aa0d050b8af9e8df4e0c3.webp?t=1773392923\" width=354 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.webm?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/f31622f78d30dd917a2e08463ee8da3d.mp4?t=1773392923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your dungeon by arranging paths, traps, and tiles. Intruders will follow the routes you lay out, and traps will hinder their advance. Create the most lethal dungeon possible and overwhelm your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/710178153451b0432c63e0ad4a0a4838.webp?t=1773392923\" width=497 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/extras/10432ba3b7809d84ed718eba26e35600.poster.avif?t=1773392923\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.ak