ue choices influence outcomes, adding layers of narrative and unexpected events. Who will become your ally, and who will turn out to be your enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense &amp; Making </strong>doesn\u2019t have a single correct solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you build your dungeon\u2014and how you choose to stop the invaders\u2014is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of chasing the perfect defense we hope you\u2019ll enjoy adapting to new challenges <br>and finding your own unique way to overcome them.</p>","developers":["3DAYS"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496110/baba544f4843f9bd1935e8addd292faeb7ee9c35/header.jpg?t=1773392923","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2026. 3DAYS Co, LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3496110/1300320498/a25e8088ca096831d36d53df9cecbafdc9038395/1763704476/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763705449","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3496110/1300320498/a25e8088ca096831d36d53df9cecbafdc9038395/1763704476/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763705449","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3496110/1300320498/a25e8088ca096831d36d53df9cecbafdc9038395/1763704476/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763705449","id":257235650,"name":"Defense&Making Teaser 2 en","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235650/b920303b6dc2bec98badc43997010cfd0eee040e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763705449"}],"name":"Defense&Making","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option